      "text": "We also got two iced lemon teas"
    },
    {
      "start": 1139.476,
      "duration": 3.908,
      "text": "Eight yuan each, normal for here"
    },
    {
      "start": 1143.601,
      "duration": 1.87,
      "text": "Walked in the park in the afternoon"
    },
    {
      "start": 1146.143,
      "duration": 0.811,
      "text": "Nice weather, soft light"
    },
    {
      "start": 1147.315,
      "duration": 0.27,
      "text": "Plenty of people running and walking dogs"
    },
    {
      "start": 1147.866,
      "duration": 0.445,
      "text": "We found a bench and sat down"
    },
    {
      "start": 1148.504,
      "duration": 4.644,
      "text": "Talked about work for a while"
    },
    {
      "start": 1153.805,
      "duration": 1.336,
      "text": "He is changing jobs next month"
    },
    {
      "start": 1155.734,
      "duration": 4.72,
      "text": "I wished him luck"
    },
    {
      "start": 1161.031,
      "duration": 1.356,
      "text": "Still thinking about the food on the way home"
    },
    {
      "start": 1162.791,
      "duration": 4.291,
      "text": "Bring the family next time"
    },
    {
      "start": 1167.373,
      "duration": 0.599,
      "text": "Thanks for watching"
    },
    {
      "start": 1168.606,
      "duration": 0.27,
      "text": "Remember to like and subscribe"
    },
    {
      "start": 1169.556,
      "duration": 0.559,
      "text": "See you next time"
    },
    {
      "start": 1170.472,
      "duration": 3.398,
      "text": "That's all for today"
    },
    {
      "start": 1174.307,
      "duration": 4.294,
      "text": "There are more small shops worth a look"
    },
    {
      "start": 1178.802,
      "duration": 4.72,
      "text": "Not enough time, next trip"
    },
    {
      "start": 1184.044,
      "duration": 4.701,
      "text": "Passed a fruit stall on the road"
    },
    {
      "start": 1189.1,
      "duration": 0.431,
      "text": "The mangoes looked fresh"
    },
    {
      "start": 1189.843,
      "duration": 1.265,
      "text": "Bought two jin, fifteen yuan"
    },
    {
      "start": 1191.838,
      "duration": 0.27,
      "text": "The owner threw in an orange"
    },
    {
      "start": 1192.471,
      "duration": 4.605,
      "text": "You do not see that much in a big city"
    },
    {
      "start": 1197.762,
      "duration": 3.676,
      "text": "A new bakery opened by the station"
    },
    {
      "start": 1201.592,
      "duration": 3.003,
      "text": "The croissants were golden in the window"
    },
    {
      "start": 1204.911,
      "duration": 4.72,
      "text": "Could not resist buying one"
    },
    {
      "start": 1210.154,
      "duration": 2.935,
      "text": "Crisp outside, soft inside"
    },
    {
      "start": 1213.098,
      "duration": 2.454,
      "text": "Just right with an americano"
    },
    {
      "start": 1215.593,
      "duration": 2.293,
      "text": "Salt & pepper, and a 5 < 10 deal on the sign"
    },
    {
      "start": 1217.961,
      "duration": 0.27,
      "text": "That is what a weekend morning is for"
    },
    {
      "start": 1218.889,
      "duration": 0.544,
      "text": "What do you eat for breakfast where you live"
    },
    {
      "start": 1219.903,
      "duration": 1.5,
      "text": "Tell me in the comments"
    }
  ]
}
